+## Version 1.0.1 disclosure correction (APP-000004)
+
+The retained 1.0.0 implementation and fixtures remain separately replayable under factory/baselines/dora-1.0.0. Version 1.0.1 preserves all deployment thresholds, arithmetic and causal requirements. An observed recovery at or before the follow-up cutoff with no qualifying attributed failure now reports missing_failure_causality and partial measurement health. It creates no failure count, duration or recovery sample. Future observations beyond the requested follow-up cutoff do not affect health for that snapshot. The prior normative contract governs independent qualification; candidate output supplies no adoption authority.
